        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_02",
      "hash64": "56D19E9ADF00CD7A",
      "text": "Der Akademiekiosk dieser Lehranstalt bietet\\nwahrlich ein fabelhaftes Warenangebot feil.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_03",
      "hash64": "56D19F9ADF00CF2D",
      "text": "Bisher habe ich stets nur die Nase darüber\\ngerümpft. Mich dünkt, damit lag ich im Unrecht.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_04",
      "hash64": "E3AE74C104646246",
      "text": "Der Akademiekiosk scheint es ihm echt angetan\\nzu haben...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_05",
      "hash64": "E3AE75C1046463F9",
      "text": "Ich denke nicht, dass er uns jetzt noch bemerkt,\\nda können wir uns das Flüstern auch sparen.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_06",
      "hash64": "E3AE72C104645EE0",
      "text": "Von allen Team-Star-Mitgliedern mache ich mir\\nbei Shugi am meisten Sorgen um die Integration...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_04",
      "hash64": "56D1989ADF00C348",
      "text": "Seid gegrüßt, werte Verkäuferin![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_05",
      "hash64": "56D1999ADF00C4FB",
      "text": "Ich wünsche, das auf fünf Exemplare limitierte\\nNinja-Kostümset zu erwerben, welches seit heute\\r\\nin Ihrem prächtigen Laden offeriert wird.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_shop_01",
      "hash64": "CEB99516CE53ECD8",
      "text": "Ähm, das Ninja-Kostümset?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_shop_02",
      "hash64": "CEB99816CE53F1F1",
      "text": "Tut mir leid, das ist leider ausverkauft. Die letzten\\nzwei Exemplare hat vorhin jemand erworben...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_06",
      "hash64": "56D19A9ADF00C6AE",
      "text": "Wie bitte?![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_07",
      "hash64": "56D19B9ADF00C861",
      "text": "Aber ohne dieses famose Gewand kann ich...\\nDann können wir nicht...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_08",
      "hash64": "56D1949ADF00BC7C",
      "text": "Wohlan, dann bleibt mir keine andere Wahl,\\nals besagten Käufer aufzuspüren![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_09",
      "hash64": "56D1959ADF00BE2F",
      "text": "Ich werde ihm mit meinem stechenden Blick tief\\nin die Augen sehen... und ihn auf Knien anflehen,\\r\\nmeiner Wenigkeit die Kostüme zu überlassen![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_07",
      "hash64": "E3AE73C104646093",
      "text": "Oh wow, ich wusste gar nicht, wie Shugi unter\\nseiner Kapuze aussieht...![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_08",
      "hash64": "E3AE80C1046476AA",
      "text": "A-Aber darum geht’s jetzt nicht! Wenn Shugi vor\\ndem Käufer wirklich bettelnd auf die Knie fällt,\\r\\nkönnte er schnell zum Gespött werden...\\c\\nWir sollten ihn aufhalten, meinst du nicht auch?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 191,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "9C6186E66962170A",
      "text": "Ja, wir sollten einschreiten!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "9C6181E669620E8B",
      "text": "Nein, wir sollten erst mal abwarten.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_09a",
      "hash64": "45FEB6FA76B84DF4",
      "text": "G-Genau![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_09b",
      "hash64": "45FEB9FA76B8530D",
      "text": "Was? Aber...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_01",
      "hash64": "CFF667CFE19942AD",
      "text": "Oh, Meister Shugi! Hier seid Ihr!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_10",
      "hash64": "56D5229ADF03E39D",
      "text": "Mein treuer Kamerad![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_11",
      "hash64": "56D5219ADF03E1EA",
      "text": "Ich... habe versagt.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_12",
      "hash64": "56D5209ADF03E037",
      "text": "Die Ninja-Kostüme, welche ich für uns beide\\nzu erwerben versprach...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_02",
      "hash64": "CFF664CFE1993D94",
      "text": "Genau deshalb bin ich hier! Ich konnte zwei\\ndavon ergattern!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_13",
      "hash64": "56D51F9ADF03DE84",
      "text": "Oha...?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_03",
      "hash64": "CFF665CFE1993F47",
      "text": "Als ich vorhin im Kiosk vorbeigeschaut habe,\\nlagen noch zwei Exemplare in der Auslage, also\\r\\nhabe ich gleich eins für Euch mitgekauft.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_04",
      "hash64": "CFF662CFE1993A2E",
      "text": "Da hatten wir wirklich Glück, diese Outfits\\ngehen immer weg wie warme Semmeln!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_05",
      "hash64": "CFF663CFE1993BE1",
      "text": "Lasst uns gleich nach draußen gehen und den\\nWeg des Ninja einschlagen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_14",
      "hash64": "56D51E9ADF03DCD1",
      "text": "Damit hätte sich meine Suche nach dem Käufer ja\\nerübrigt... Welch glückliche Fügung des Schicksals![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_15",
      "hash64": "56D51D9ADF03DB1E",
      "text": "Dann werde ich noch kurz in mein Gemach\\neinkehren, um meine Wurfsterne zu holen.\\c\\nDas verleiht unseren Kostümen zusätzliche\\nAuthentizität.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_06",
      "hash64": "CFF660CFE19936C8",
      "text": "Ooooh, brillante Idee!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_16",
      "hash64": "56D51C9ADF03D96B",
      "text": "Mit meinen geschickten Fingern könnte ich auch\\nNadel und Faden schwingen, um den Kostümen\\r\\neinen Hauch von Giftigkeit zu verleihen![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_07",
      "hash64": "CFF661CFE199387B",
      "text": "Hmmm... Muss nicht sein.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
